To enumerate breaking changes, on Mac, AppData goes from `/home/.config` today to `/home/Library/Application Support` and LocalAppData goes from `/home/.local/share` to `/home/Library/` and Documents/Personal from `/home` to `/home/Documents` and Videos from `/home/Videos` to `/home/Movies` . While on Linux, Documents/Personal goes from `/home` to XDG_DOCUMENTS_DIR.

@marklio thoughts about the impact of the break here? As always, it's a major update, so if we think it's the right change, it may well be acceptable to correct all these.

@dotnet/area-system-runtime thoughts?

It's quite remarkable how much discussion this has involved, and this is only some of the proposed changes. https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/issues/63214 is just one of the long discussions.

My inclination is to take this and look for feedback on Preview 5+.
